2. Prompt text reused: astrbot_plugin_mi_fitness_health
-----------------------------------------------------------
Some prompt text used by the proactive-care night scenario is taken verbatim
from astrbot_plugin_mi_fitness_health (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026
Aleksej Kubulashvili). Full license text kept in
LICENSE-astrbot_plugin_mi_fitness_health.txt.

Reused verbatim (prompt text only):
  * the "is a late-night care message worth sending right now" decision prompt;
  * the private-context template that wraps the recent chat lines;
  * the wording instruction for the composed message (length / tone rules).

